# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.46 with `absent` (0.9) on `json`: the text
# is compared before any lookup. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-charset-absent-json
version 0.46.0
distribution public
source  "synthetic format, no external standard"
uses    probe
wire    json
charset L  ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ
charset D  0123456789
field   probe.s1  call  codestr:L,L,D,D,D  absent NONE
field   probe.x   num   codenum:D,D        absent NA
